OL,3,GNEWSAMother's tribute to 'beautiful
OL,4,Aboy' killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has paid tribute to her
OL,7,F"beautiful boy", who died when his car
OL,8,Fhit a wall.
OL,10,FLancashire Police said Jack Jones died
OL,11,Fin a crash in Crown Point Road,
OL,12,FBurnley, on 13 October, when his grey
OL,13,FSkoda Octavia estate hit a dry-stone
OL,14,Fwall at about 19:00 BST.
OL,16,FThe 23-year-old was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,19,FIn a tribute his mother said he was a
OL,20,F"loving, kind and fabulously funny man"
OL,21,Fwho "will always be loved" by his
OL,22,Fbrothers and girlfriend.
